second artist, birth date for a different person, or second sport is evidence to retain it. Check each proposed deletion once more against all originals before producing the final short list.\nInput: {\"question\": \"What is the population of Vermillion Township?\", \"slot_hint\": \"other\", \"all_original_sources\": {\"D1S1\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0117-759c06d74eb9:d00\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 123, \"text\": \"Vermillion Township, Dakota County, Minnesota Vermillion Township is a township in Dakota County, Minnesota, United States.\"}, \"D1S2\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0117-759c06d74eb9:d00\", \"start\": 124, \"end\": 168, \"text\": \"The population was 1,243 at the 2000 census.\"}, \"D1S3\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0117-759c06d74eb9:d00\", \"start\": 169, \"end\": 256, \"text\": \"Vermillion Township was organized in 1858, and took its name from the Vermillion River.\"}, \"D1S4\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0117-759c06d74eb9:d00\", \"start\": 257, \"end\": 381, \"text\": \"According to the United States Census Bureau, the township has a total area of 34.1 square miles (88.4 km²), all of it land.\"}, \"D1S5\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0117-759c06d74eb9:d00\", \"start\": 382, \"end\": 491, \"text\": \"As of the census of 2000, there were 1,243 people, 395 households, and 325 families residing in the township.\"}, \"D1S6\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0117-759c06d74eb9:d00\", \"start\": 492, \"end\": 558, \"text\": \"The population density was 36.4 people per square mile (14.1/km²).\"}, \"D1S7\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0117-759c06d74eb9:d00\", \"start\": 559, \"end\": 612, \"text\": \"There were 403 housing units at an average density of\"}, \"D2S1\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0117-759c06d74eb9:d01\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 63, \"text\": \"12.2 % 2000 1,243 3.5 % 2010 1,192 −4.1 % 2020 1,290 8.2 % U.S.\"}, \"D2S2\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0117-759c06d74eb9:d01\", \"start\": 64, \"end\": 206, \"text\": \"Decennial Census [ 4 ] As of the census [ 1 ] of 2000 , there were 1,243 people , 395 households , and 325 families residing in the township .\"}, \"D2S3\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0117-759c06d74eb9:d01\", \"start\": 207, \"end\": 282, \"text\": \"The population density was 36.4 inhabitants per square mile ( 14.1/km 2 ) .\"}, \"D2S4\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0117-759c06d74eb9:d01\", \"start\": 283, \"end\": 362, \"text\": \"There were 403 housing units at an average density of 11.8/sq mi ( 4.6/km 2 ) .\"}, \"D2S5\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0117-759c06d74eb9:d01\", \"start\": 363, \"end\": 474, \"text\": \"The racial makeup of the township was 97.51 % White , 0.16 % African American , 0.32 % Native American , 0.16 %\"}, \"D3S1\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0117-759c06d74eb9:d02\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 1, \"text\": \".\"}, \"D3S2\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0117-759c06d74eb9:d02\", \"start\": 2, \"end\": 6, \"text\": \"mi .\"}, \"D3S3\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0117-759c06d74eb9:d02\", \"start\": 7, \"end\": 28, \"text\": \"Water area : 0.0 sq .\"}, \"D3S4\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0117-759c06d74eb9:d02\", \"start\": 29, \"end\": 33, \"text\": \"mi .\"}, \"D3S5\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0117-759c06d74eb9:d02\", \"start\": 34, \"end\": 451, \"text\": \"Population : 1,243 ( all rural ) Males : 654 ( 52.6 % ) Females : 589 ( 47.4 % ) Occupied houses/apartments : 1,243 ( 1,170 owner occupied , 73 renter occupied ) % of renters here : 6 % State : 25 % Races in Vermillion township : White Non-Hispanic : 97.5 % Black : 0.2 % American Indian and Alaska Native : 0.3 % Asian : 0.2 % Native Hawaiian and Other Pacific Islander : 0.1 % Hispanic or Latino : 1.0 % 